<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Joomla update server manifest.

  🔴 The JED has REQUIRED an update server of every extension submitted since
  10 January 2017. This file is what the <updateservers> element in
  pulseanalytics.xml points at, and it must be hosted at exactly that URL:

      https://cdn.ciphera.net/joomla/pulse-update.xml

  It is a static file. There is no backend, nothing to run, and nothing to
  authenticate — but until it is actually SERVING, the manifest names a URL that
  404s, every installed site silently reports "no updates available" forever,
  and a JED reviewer will fail the listing on it.

  🔁 HOST CHANGED 16-09-2026: pulse.ciphera.net -> cdn.ciphera.net.
  pulse.ciphera.net is a Bunny pull zone in front of the Next.js app, so
  /joomla/* was caught by the app and 307'd to /login, then answered 200 with
  HTML. A status-code check passed and Joomla's updater would have parsed a
  login page as update XML and reported "no updates available" — identical to
  being up to date. cdn.ciphera.net is storage-backed with no app in the path.

  ⚠️ THE ZONE CACHES EVERYTHING FOR A YEAR (edge rule "Cache all assets for 1
  year", pattern *). An edge rule added 16-09-2026 gives */joomla/*.xml a 300s
  TTL instead; without it a release would be invisible to every Joomla site
  until the TTL lapsed. The zip is fine on the 1-year rule because its filename
  carries the version. Purge this file on every release anyway.

  ⚠️ `targetplatform` lives HERE, not in the install manifest. The install
  manifest has no compatibility gate at all: Joomla will happily install this
  extension on any version. This regex is what actually stops Joomla offering
  the update to a core it was not tested on, so widen it only after running
  ./scripts/verify.sh against the new version.
-->
<updates>
	<update>
		<name>Pulse Analytics</name>
		<description>Privacy-first web analytics. No cookies, no personal data, under 3 KB.</description>
		<element>pulseanalytics</element>
		<type>plugin</type>
		<folder>system</folder>
		<client>0</client>
		<version>1.0.0</version>
		<infourl title="Pulse Analytics">https://pulse.ciphera.net</infourl>
		<downloads>
			<downloadurl type="full" format="zip">https://cdn.ciphera.net/joomla/plg_system_pulseanalytics-1.0.0.zip</downloadurl>
		</downloads>
		<tags>
			<tag>stable</tag>
		</tags>
		<maintainer>Ciphera</maintainer>
		<maintainerurl>https://ciphera.net</maintainerurl>
		<targetplatform name="joomla" version="5\.[0-9]+|6\.[0-9]+" />
		<php_minimum>8.1</php_minimum>
	</update>
</updates>
